{"id":"vod_bf_47028","vodId":"47028","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"罪恶王冠","name_cn":"罪恶王冠","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-48/565f7b1d1c2e869d39e8ad20782cc703.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在2029年，被病毒袭击的日本陷入了混乱之后被名为“GHQ”的暴力组织全面接手，政府逐渐成为了傀儡。在这样动荡的大环境下，樱满集（梶裕贵 配音）只是一名平凡的高中生，过着属于他的平凡生活，直到那个叫做楪祈（茅野爱衣 配音）的少女出现在他的眼前。　　祈的真实身份为“葬仪社”的成员，这个社团以从GHQ的手上夺回日本自治权为目标不断进行着危险而残酷的战争。在组织首领恙神涯（中村悠一 配音）的引导之下，集成为了组织的一员，结识了同僚筱宫绫濑（花泽香菜 配音）和鸫（竹达彩奈 配音）等人。随着战斗的升级，各种迹象显示出集似乎拥有着神秘的力量，而躲在诸多敌人背后的究竟是怎样强大的存在，众人无从而知……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 17:59:10","playable":true,"episodeCount":22,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/zuiewangguan/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241022PvX8jpwqindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/2024102244uejdd6index.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/zuiewangguan/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/zuiewangguan/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241022EE7P46V2index.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/zuiewangguan/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/zuiewangguan/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/202410223qjEVEU6index.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/zuiewangguan/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/zuiewangguan/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241022Z0Njqgfgindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvv